[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584912\">5520B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Loosen the bands (1a) and (1b) and remove the  oil vapour recovery\npipe from cam cover to crankcase (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021918.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Refit the oil vapour recovery pipe from\ncam cover to crankcase and secure with bands.</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584912\">5520B10</a>\n                                           .</p>"]]